Probably like 13 or something.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:03.840
13, 14, yeah.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:04.860
- All right.
- Yeah.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:05.970
- And then what do I do?
- What are yours?

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:07.290
