It was so sad.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.180
It was like this sad,

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.670
which shows my relationship to drama,

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.250
'cause I just loved...
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.083
- Playing these deep-

00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:32.100
- "Baby Blue Eyes" wasn't
a happy song, yeah.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.820
Mine wasn't a happy song, no.
- It wasn't?

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.970
Well, I like...
- Yeah it's sad.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.230
- Yeah, okay.
- You didn't end up

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.580
with the baby blue eyes.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.520
- Yeah, I'm trying to remember the lyrics.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.353
So it was,

00:01:43.354 --> 00:01:45.394
♪ I wish I could have ♪

00:01:45.394 --> 00:01:47.005
